<mark name="m81245--fs-id1628108--question"/><p>Ing gladhen iki, rampungna soal.
Blanja Sawijining sepedha gunung didol kanthi rega promosi telung atus sangang puluh sanga dolar Amérika Sarékat Rega lumrahe yaiku nem atus sèket dolar Amérika Sarékat Pira selisih rega lumrah lan rega promosine?</p><break time="600ms"/>
<mark name="m81245--fs-id1628108--answer"/><p>Wangsulan saka sumber:
Selisih rega lumrah lan rega promosi yaiku $251.</p><break time="600ms"/>
<mark name="m81245--fs-id2661110--question"/><p>Ing gladhen iki, rampungna soal.
